    blurb: "Why analytics needs different storage from the transactional app: OLTP vs OLAP, column-oriented storage and compression, data warehouses and lakes, and how data flows from production databases to analytics without hurting users.",
    signals: ["Dashboards and reports over billions of rows", "Analytics queries slowing the production database", "\"Revenue by country last quarter\"", "Choosing BigQuery, a warehouse or a data lake"],
